| description = The Goblins and hangers on in [[Runnyeye]], as well as most everything in [[Beholders Maze]]. They are opposed by the halflings of [[Rivervale]], especially the [[Guardians of the Vale]] and [[Storm Reapers]] who struggle to keep them beyond The Wall of [[Misty Thicket]]. They have also established camps in the distant [[Butcherblock Mountains]] and are opposed by the [[Storm Guard]] dwarves there.

They seem to be associated with or subjugated by the [[Pickclaw Goblins]] found deeper within [[Runnyeye]] and the [[Highkeep]] basement.

It takes ''a lot'' of work to raise this faction: even 385 kills in [[Gorge of King Xorbb]] (enough to raise [[Pickclaw Goblins]] to non-KOS) isn't even enough to raise this faction to "threatening".

